  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When sweeping through enemies, you can disrupt their defensive stance.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Surprise Follow-Through<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Cleave or Great Cleave, if you hit more than one creature you may choose any of the creatures you hit to become flat-footed until the beginning of your next turn or until it is struck by an attack that requires an attack roll.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc107\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
